—	_input.py#/Module/5/arguments/0/id	Exception
—	_input.py#/Module/5/body/0/value/value	"""A pathname that names neither a directory nor a regular file, a directory that cannot be listed, and a file named directly that cannot be read MUST be refused with the reason: names neither a directory nor a regular file, cannot be listed, or cannot be read.\n\nA pathname that is not absolute MUST be refused as not absolute."""
